    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d1192-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d1192-f1-content">
                <p>Submitted on the Committee’s initiative, in consultation with the Combined
                    Shipping Adjustment Board. Considered at the 201st Meeting of the Joint Chiefs
                    of Staff, July 23 (see <hi rendition="#italic">ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg272"
                        >p. 272</ref>) and at the 199th Meeting of the Combined Chiefs of Staff,
                    July 23 (see <hi rendition="#italic">ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg294">p.
                        294</ref>).</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1192-f2" n="2" xml:id="d1192-f2-content">
                <p>Signed at London, August 5, 1944 (Treaties and Other International Agreements
                    Series No. 1722; 61 Stat. (4) 3784).</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
